	(descr "Taoglas WDP.2458.25.4.B.02 25x25x4 mm pin-fed ceramic patch, 2.4/5 GHz, adhesive mount on solid GND. Feed pin dia 0.9+/-0.2, 2.4+/-0.4 long, at (+1.8,+1.8) from centre (datasheet SPE-14-8-039-F rev F p.9). Pad 1 = RF feed (plated 1.3 mm hole), pad 2 = GND copper under the patch (F.Cu only, mask kept), In1/In2 void dia 4.0 at the feed. https://www.taoglas.com/datasheets/WDP.2458.25.4.B.02.pdf")
